        "_uid": "4d3aec14-d806-dcdf-23a7-0d458f098d37",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The paper presented insights into a case study of six students continuous learning and transformation through professional development portfolios at AKU-IED introduced in teacher learning course. The second paper was on 'Building Capacities of Teachers in Early Childhood Education Programmes': Case studies from Pakistan co-authored by Dr Vazir and Ms Saima Khalid, Instructor, AKU-IED. The paper highlighted the effective implementation of learning from the Early Childhood Education and Development (ECED) Certificate in Education Programme offered at AKU-IED through a case study of three teachers who participated in the ECED certificate programme. The papers were received well and generated a lot of interest among the participants for further discussion and seeking insights.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
