    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Nilofar Vazir presented two papers at the International Congress for Schools Effectiveness and Improvement 2009: Departures for a learning world of quality and equality held in Vancouver, B.C, Canada from January 4-8, 2009. Being an international forum, it provides a great opportunity for AKU-IED to disseminate its research and development work, particularly if it emanates from classroom teaching. Dr Vazir has been a member on the congress for last five years and has been invited to present papers each year. This year her paper presentation included one on 'Professional Development Portfolio as a way of transforming teachers: A case from Pakistan co-authored by Dr Vazir and Dr Ayesha Bashiruddin, Assistant Professor, AKU-IED.",
